B.aUG=new A.h_("2. Eligibility","You must be at least 18 years of age (or the legal gambling age in your jurisdiction, whichever is higher) to use this Service. By using the Service you confirm that you meet this requirement. We reserve the right to verify your age at any time and to close your account if you are found to be underage.")
B.aUF=new A.h_("3. Account Registration","You must provide accurate and complete information when creating an account. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your wallet credentials and for all activity that occurs under your account. You may only hold one account per person. Duplicate accounts may be closed without notice.")
B.aUO=new A.h_("4. Responsible Gambling","We are committed to promoting responsible gambling. You may set deposit limits, session time limits, or request a self-exclusion period via your account settings. If you believe you have a gambling problem, please contact a responsible gambling organisation such as GamCare, BeGambleAware, or Gamblers Anonymous.")
B.aUI=new A.h_("5. Deposits & Withdrawals","All deposits and withdrawals are processed in cryptocurrency. Minimum deposit is 0.10 USDT (or equivalent). Withdrawal requests are subject to identity verification and anti-money-laundering checks. We reserve the right to delay or refuse withdrawals where fraud or suspicious activity is suspected.")
B.aUz=new A.h_("6. Bonuses & Promotions","All bonuses are subject to wagering requirements as specified at the time of the offer. Bonuses are non-transferable and may not be exchanged for cash unless otherwise stated. Abuse of bonus terms will result in forfeiture of the bonus and any winnings derived from it.")
B.aUU=new A.h_("7. Prohibited Activities","You must not use the Service for any unlawful purpose, attempt to manipulate game outcomes, use bots or automated scripts, collude with other players, or engage in any form of fraudulent activity. Violation of these terms will result in immediate account suspension and forfeiture of funds.")
B.aUN=new A.h_("8. Intellectual Property","All content, software, graphics, logos, and trademarks on the Service are owned by or licensed to us. You may not copy, reproduce, or distribute any content without our prior written permission.")
B.aUV=new A.h_("9. Limitation of Liability","To the maximum extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Service. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount deposited by you in the 30 days preceding the event giving rise to the claim.")
B.aUR=new A.h_("10. Governing Law","These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which the operator is licensed. Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of that jurisdiction.")
B.aUA=new A.h_("11. Changes to Terms","We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Material changes will be communicated via in-app notification. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.")
B.aUH=new A.h_("12. Contact","For any questions regarding these Terms, please contact us at support@cryptocasino.com.")
