B.aUL=new A.h_("1. Introduction","We are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your data. By using our Service, you consent to the practices described in this policy.")
B.aUW=new A.h_("2. Information We Collect","We collect: (a) Identity data \u2014 wallet address, username, and KYC documents where required; (b) Transaction data \u2014 deposit/withdrawal amounts, bet history, and win/loss records; (c) Technical data \u2014 IP address, device type, browser information, and usage logs; (d) Communications \u2014 support tickets and chat messages.")
B.aUS=new A.h_("3. How We Use Your Information","Your information is used to: provide and maintain the Service; process transactions and settle bets; verify your identity and comply with legal obligations; detect and prevent fraud; personalise your experience; send promotional communications (with your consent); and improve our platform through analytics.")
B.aUC=new A.h_("4. Legal Basis for Processing","We process your personal data under the following legal bases: (a) Contract \u2014 processing is necessary to fulfil our obligations to you; (b) Legal obligation \u2014 KYC/AML compliance; (c) Legitimate interests \u2014 fraud prevention and security; (d) Consent \u2014 marketing communications.")
B.aUK=new A.h_("5. Data Sharing","We do not sell your personal data. We may share your data with: payment processors and blockchain networks to complete transactions; identity verification providers for KYC/AML; regulatory authorities as required by law; fraud prevention agencies; and service providers acting as data processors on our behalf.")
B.aUD=new A.h_("6. Blockchain Transparency","Please note that transactions recorded on a public blockchain are publicly visible and immutable. Your wallet address and transaction amounts may be visible to third parties. We have no control over blockchain data once a transaction is confirmed on-chain.")
B.aUT=new A.h_("7. Data Retention","We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active and for a period of 5 years following account closure, to comply with anti-money-laundering and financial record-keeping obligations. Transaction logs are retained for 7 years as required by applicable law.")
B.aUM=new A.h_("8. Security","We implement industry-standard security measures including TLS encryption, JWT authentication, rate limiting, and regular security audits. However, no system is completely secure. You are responsible for keeping your wallet credentials safe.")
B.aUB=new A.h_("9. Your Rights","Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to: access, rectify, or erase your personal data; restrict or object to processing; data portability; and withdraw consent. To exercise these rights, contact us at privacy@cryptocasino.com. Note that some rights may be limited by our legal obligations.")
B.aUJ=new A.h_("10. Cookies","We use essential session cookies to maintain your authenticated session. No third-party advertising or tracking cookies are used. You may clear cookies via your browser settings, though this will log you out.")
B.aUQ=new A.h_("11. Changes to This Policy","We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes via an in-app announcement. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Policy.")
B.aUE=new A.h_("12. Contact Us","For privacy-related enquiries, contact our Data Protection Officer at: privacy@cryptocasino.com.")
